# NTCP2 Transport Implementation

This directory contains the NTCP2 (NIO-based TCP version 2) transport implementation.

NTCP2 is based on:
- Noise Protocol Framework (XK pattern)
- X25519 for key exchange
- ChaCha20-Poly1305 for encryption
- SHA256 for hashing

Key differences from NTCP1:
- Uses Noise XK handshake instead of DH
- ChaCha20-Poly1305 AEAD instead of AES-CBC
- Ephemeral key obfuscation with AES
- Frame-based protocol with SipHash length obfuscation
- Improved resistance to DPI and traffic analysis
- Block-based payload format
